  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1226314-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "if conduits draining a large balancing pond or tank of the prior art type become blocked, localised flooding could occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100435535-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional sidewalk block has a problem that the flooding area occurs frequently in the case where the drainage is vulnerable because the phenomenon that the rain water is not submerged through the ground of the block and concentrated in the sewer pipe occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100519106-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the phenomenon occurs, and there is a problem that the flooding damage occurs in the lowlands.accordingly, the present invention is to solve the above problems, the backflow of the drain to prevent the rainwater backflow through the drain cover to prevent the backflow through the backflow prevention device that can block the drainage the object is to provide a prevention device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100519106-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention backflow prevention device configured as described above, it is possible to block the occurrence of flooding damage by preventing the rainwater backflow through the drain cover through the backflow prevention device that can block the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100654756-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent the sewage flow back to the upper side of the water collecting manhole during rainy or rainy season, the drainage 42 of the fixing plate 40 is blocked so that all of the drainage holes 42 of the fixing plate 40 are prevented from flooding the road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101178211-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention is to block the upper surface of the drain cover due to foreign matters, or in particular, even when a large amount of water in a moment of heavy rain or heavy rains can be drained smoothly without clogging with foreign matter, so that the water around the drain cover it not only prevents seizing but also provides excellent effects to prevent flooding and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by providing the guide block 66 on the upper side of the drainage passage 52, rainwater that suddenly overflows due to heavy rainfall or the like is prevented, so that flooding of the earths due to heavy rainfall can be stably prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101923707-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention also provides a device for continuously removing foreign matter flowing into a drainage channel together with rainwater, thereby preventing a flooding caused by blocking the drainage port with foreign matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102253598-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem in that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1 , the flooding diffusion prevention system may include a drain module 100 , a flood control module 200 , and a blocking module 300 so that water can be flushed and drained"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102569525-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "4 is a block diagram showing a control system of a drainage system for preventing road flooding according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, especially in the rainy season or in the fall, foreign substances such as fallen leaves can block the inlet, making it difficult to drain, which can easily lead to flooding and human casualties"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2a.as described above, the present invention is capable of blocking sewage or sewage that flows back from a drainage hole in which sewage and sewage are combined in a heavy rain or rainy season, and thus, has an effect of preventing flooding of lowland and basement houses"}, {"pat_id": "US-10422119-B2", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "if this occurs, the water may still be able to pass through the openings 42 in the corners to prevent water from backing up or flooding over into other areas because the drain is blocked"}, {"pat_id": "US-10422119-B2", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "if this occurs, the water may still be able to pass through the openings 42 in the center to prevent water from backing up or flooding over into other areas because the material 34 over the drain 44 is blocked"}, {"pat_id": "US-10753077-B2", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "if this occurs, the water may still be able to pass through the openings 42 in the corners to prevent water from backing up or flooding over into other areas because the drain is blocked"}, {"pat_id": "US-10753077-B2", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "if this occurs, the water may still be able to pass through the openings 42 in the center to prevent water from backing up or flooding over into other areas because the material 34 over the drain 44 is blocked"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the drainage line becomes clogged or blocked with debris, ice, or as a result of build-up inside the pipe, a flooding event can occur in the building if adequate precautions are not taken"}, {"pat_id": "US-4180094-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the drain cover 12 is placed over a drain 14 in the floor 16 to prevent water backing up in the sewage system from flooding into the building in which the drain 14 is located"}, {"pat_id": "US-4457646-A", "para_id": "para