911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, as the rainwater is further collected through the bottom of the rainwater container, the drainage speed is lowered, and contaminants introduced with the rainwater are accumulated on the floor"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101192911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, the rainwater that passes through the rainwater container to the main drain pipe through the branch drain pipe has a flow rate that causes foreign substances or contaminants that pass through the rainwater container to be caught or accumulated in the branch drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a water purification filtration layer formed on the upper and lower trench conduits to remove contaminants in rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a filtration step for purifying water to remove contaminants in rainwater formed on the upper and lower trench conduits"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a water purification filtration layer (70) formed on the upper and lower trench conduits (50, 60) to remove contaminants in rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a water purification filtration step formed on the inner surface of the upper and lower trench conduits 50 and 60 to remove contaminants in rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this, the rainwater introduced into the water collection tank 40 along the raw water inlet pipe 46 may include a contaminant and mud not filtered by the screen filter 20 described above, the bottom of the collecting tank 40 there is an effect of sinking by spraying in the down direction of the sump (40)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this, the rainwater introduced into the water collection tank 40 along the raw water inlet pipe 46 may include a contaminant and mud not filtered by the screen filter 20 described above, the bottom of the collect