e pressure tank 314 is increased because the pressurized water does not flow smoothly into the flotation tank 200 due to the blockage of the microbubble injection unit 320, the water level sensor 334 detects the pump 312"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101296571-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "the method of claim 3, the stopper is a water level sensor comprising a leak prevention packing to prevent leakage by contacting the water purification tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101296571-B1", "para_id": "claim_4", "text": "the method of claim 3, the stopper is a water level sensor comprising a leak prevention packing to prevent leakage by contacting the water purification tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101306120-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is characterized in that the anti-pollution cap is configured to be coupled to the upper side of the casing to support the water level sensor to prevent contaminants from entering the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101311288-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the drainage pump is provided with a water level sensor to drain the stagnant water while the position of the sediment detector descends to the settled contaminant surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101388033-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if the water level of the sewage is continuously increased, the bure member 54 is raised and the sensing block 56c is lowered, so that the sensing block 56c is the fourth contact sensor 58d, the third contact sensor 58c, and the second"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101408121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the plurality of detection sensors may be different depending on the structure or form of the cold / hot water supply device 100, and may include, for example, a water level sensor 612, cold water (hot water) temperature sensors 624 and 634, (wire or the like) sensor signal receiver 740 receives signals from the plurality of sensor sensors 640, 660, a water leakage sensor 670, one or more overflow sensors 690, can do"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101408121-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": 