ce more from the strainer, and then remove the foreign substance in the sedimentation chamber for final precipitation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101039196-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this structure is to block the inflow of the initial excellent water when the internal water level of the first excellent soil chamber 21 and the second excellent soil chamber 31 is increased due to the continuous inflow of the initial excellent rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101044802-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit due to the water supply and replenishment, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of direct water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101044802-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level in the brine reservoir 5 reaches the upper limit due to the water supply and replenishment, the electric valve 11 is automatically closed to block the supply of direct water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101051656-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, water is supplied from the water storage container to the spray generator through the water supply valve, and when an appropriate amount of water is supplied to the spray generator, the water level control means rises by buoyancy and blocks the water supply valve so that water is no longer sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "such a structure is intended to block the inflow of the initial excellent water when the water level of the septic tank 30 reaches the full water level due to the continuous inflow of the initial excellent water level"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101215187-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the high water level alarm sensor 46 is a water level of the sewage and rainwater in the chamber 12 of the collecting facility 10 above the limit point because the sewage pipe 16 is not blocked in the rain due to a malfunction of the first water level detection sensor 42"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101215187-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "