tically lowered, so as to prevent this ultrasonic sensor as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, the first cover 20 and the second cover 30 is provided to cover the opening of the water tank 10 to prevent the inflow of foreign matter and infiltration of bacteria in the air, the first cover 20 the space between the second cover 30 serves as a thermal insulation space to block the influence of the external temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101368425-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, the first cover 200 covers the opening of the water tank 100 to prevent the inflow of foreign substances and the penetration of bacteria in the air, and the space between the first cover 200 and the second cover 300 is it functions as an insulated space to block the influence of the outside temperature of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101373842-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, by measuring the temperature change of the hot water inside the hot water tank through the temperature sensor, if the temperature change of the hot water over time is greater than the reference value by stopping the operation of the heating unit, heating in the absence of hot water in the hot water tank the negative operation can be blocked to prevent defective or malfunction of the heating unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101642081-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, even when only the oxidizing agent is supplied to the regeneration wastewater purification tank 140 during purification of regeneration wastewater, on the other hand, if the temperature of the regeneration wastewater is lower than the reference temperature, the oxidizing efficiency of the oxidizing agent is lowered, so that it is required to supply the reaction catalyst for promoting the oxidation reaction in addition to the oxidizing agent"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101693100-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in the above-described embodiment, although the water treatment