  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-5349271-B2", "para_id": "para_26", "text": "thus, if the water penetration hole 40h is provided in the wing-shaped vertical wall 40w of the vertical block 40, rainwater can flow through the water penetration hole 40h, so that the rainwater enters the water storage tank 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100549466-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "cylindrical filter 40 is connected to the supply pipe 30 to clean the primary filtered rainwater from the water tank 21 to filter impurities or organic matter, so that the rainwater stored in the water tank 10 is decayed by eutrophication or it is possible to prevent the end of deterioration and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, the continuous disinfection of rainwater in the storage tank requires expenditure of chemical costs, power costs, etc., and because the process is difficult to control and cumbersome, a more fundamental solution for removing the contaminants is required"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "thus, when rainwater is concentrated on the catchment surface 2 in which contamination by contaminants is prevented early by the titanium dioxide photocatalyst layer, the rainwater is transferred to the storage tank 1 through the catchment port 3 and stored"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "thus, when rainwater is concentrated on the catchment surface 2 in which contamination by contaminants is prevented early by the titanium dioxide photocatalyst layer, the rainwater is transferred to the storage tank 1 through the catchment port 3 and stored"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100660052-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "because of this, the block body 30 is installed in a row arrangement of the role of the storage tank for storing rainwater and the waterway line is formed so that the concentrated phenomenon does not occur even in a large amount of rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100702860-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the excellent storage tank of the present invention, by forming the outer wall block and the storage block in the hexahedral structure with the upper and lower sides open while the opening is formed as described above, compared to the storage block of the conventional hexahedral structure with the upper and lower plates closed, the raw material cost is reduced along with this, there is another purpose of making the outer wall block and the storage block and the construction of the rainwater storage tank through the block very easy"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100702860-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, in the case of the outer wall block (10, 10a) the inner wall of the storage tank (1) to achieve the outer wall of the storage tank (1) while smoothly flowing with the prevention of leakage of rainwater moved from each storage block (20)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100702860-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, in the case of the outer wall block (10, 10a) the inner wall of the storage tank (1) to achieve the outer wall of the storage tank (1) while smoothly flowing with the prevention of leakage of rainwater moved from each storage block (20)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100751233-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the second purification tank (11) is provided with a u-trap (t) so that rainwater can be introduced while preventing the leakage of ammonia gas, thereby fully utilizing the water resources"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100786511-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this phenomenon causes a vortex phenomenon while the rainwater including the pollutant moving in the contaminant treatment tank 13 passes through the