  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of an immovable settlement caused by an earthquake or the like, there is a problem that the connection between the panels is broken, and leakage occurs in the broken part, thereby losing the function as a water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "seismic edge reinforcement means for reinforcing the connection between the unit panels on one side and the other side provided in multiple stages on one side and the other side of the peripheral edge of the water tank body to prevent leakage of water from the peripheral edge when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seismic edge reinforcement means for reinforcing the connection between the unit panels on one side and the other side provided in multiple stages on one side and the other side of the peripheral edge of the water tank body to prevent leakage of water from the peripheral edge when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "as shown in the drawing, the seismic smc water tank (hereinafter referred to as water tank ) according to the present invention is capable of preventing water leakage from occurring in the water tank by improving seismic performance when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the present invention is a useful invention that can prevent water leakage from occurring when the lower portions of the unit panels 22 of the lowermost layer of the water tank body 2 flow outward when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "by reinforcing the connection between the two, it serves to prevent leakage from occurring at the peripheral edge of the water tank body 2 when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in the present invention, by reinforcing the connection state of the circumferential edge of the water tank through the earthquake-resistant edge reinforcing means 5, a gap is generated in the circumferential edge of the water tank during the release of an earthquake to prevent leakage"}]</data>
</edge>
