  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "EP-1226314-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "if conduits draining a large balancing pond or tank of the prior art type become blocked, localised flooding could occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100435535-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, the conventional sidewalk block has a problem that the flooding area occurs frequently in the case where the drainage is vulnerable because the phenomenon that the rain water is not submerged through the ground of the block and concentrated in the sewer pipe occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100519106-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the phenomenon occurs, and there is a problem that the flooding damage occurs in the lowlands.accordingly, the present invention is to solve the above problems, the backflow of the drain to prevent the rainwater backflow through the drain cover to prevent the backflow through the backflow prevention device that can block the drainage the object is to provide a prevention device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100519106-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention backflow prevention device configured as described above, it is possible to block the occurrence of flooding damage by preventing the rainwater backflow through the drain cover through the backflow prevention device that can block the drain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention, by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113, the rainwater from the original while performing the function of, the guerrilla torrential rain, flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100654756-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent the sewage flow back to the upper side of the water collecting manhole during rainy or rainy season, the drainage 42 of the fixing plate 40 is blocked so that all of the drainage holes 42 of the fixing plate 40 are prevented from flooding the road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100654756-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent the sewage flow back to the upper side of the water collecting manhole during rainy or rainy season, the drainage 42 of the fixing plate 40 is blocked so that all of the drainage holes 42 of the fixing plate 40 are prevented from flooding the road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101178211-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention is to block the upper surface of the drain cover due to foreign matters, or in particular, even when a large amount of water in a moment of heavy rain or heavy rains can be drained smoothly without clogging with foreign matter, so that the water around the drain cover it not only prevents seizing but also provides excellent effects to prevent flooding and the like"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518865-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by providing the guide block 66 on the upper side of the drainage passage 52, rainwater that suddenly overflows due to heavy rainfall or the like is prevented, so that flooding of the earths due to heavy rainfall can be stably prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101923707-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention also provides a device for continuously removing foreign matter flowing into a drainage channel together with rainwater, thereby preventing a flooding caused by blocking the drainage port with foreign matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102253598-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since only the same amount of drainage is always possible without, there is a problem in that when the amount of drainage increases, water congestion occurs in the drainage block, causing environmental pollution due to water pollution, and also flooding the floor of an apartment house"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1 , the flooding diffusion prevention system may include a drain module 100 , a flood control module 200 , and a blocking module 300 so that water can be flushed and drained"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102569525-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "4 is a block diagram showing a control system of a drainage system for preventing road flooding according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole block manhole block the present invention relates to a manhole block, and more specifically, is manufactured by mixing recycled aggregate (recycled aggregate) and concrete in a certain ratio to provide sufficient strength as well as eco-friendliness through efficient use of resources, as well as internal flooding due to rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "because the manhole cover is structurally exposed to the ground of the road or sidewalk, especially when it rains heavily, there is a risk of rainwater flowing into the manhole block and internal flooding, no matter how airtight the sealing treatment is"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, especially in the rainy season or in the fall, foreign substances such as fallen leaves can block the inlet, making it difficult to drain, which can easily lead to flooding and human casualties"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200190242-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "2a.as described above, the present invention is capable of blocking sewage or sewage that flows back from a drainage hole in which sewage and sewage are combined in a heavy rain or rainy season, and thus, has an effect of preventing flooding of lowland and basement houses"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200328169-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, when the sewage flows back due to rainy season or flooding, the separation of the menhole cover 2 from the support frame 12 is expected by the blocking plate 8 blocking the through hole 10 of the manhole cover 2"}, {"pat_id": "US-11560697-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the drainage line becomes clogged or blocked with debris, ice, or as a result of build-up inside the pipe, a flooding event can occur in the building if adequate precautions are not taken"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in some embodiments, the incidents and the potential incidents may include, but not limited to, blockages or flooding in the sewer manhole 201 due to increasing/decreasing in level of wastewater in the sewer manhole 201, unauthorized tampering of sewer manhole 201, presence of flammable gas in the sewer manhole 201, battery level and battery performance of the one or more additional sensors and the level sensor"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "in some embodiments, the incidents and the potential incidents may include, but not limited to, blockages or flooding in the sewer manhole 201 due to increasing/decreasing a level of wastewater in the sewer manhole 201, unauthorized tampering of sewer manhole 201, presence of flammable gas in the sewer manhole 201, battery level, and battery performance of the one or more additional sensors and the level sensor"}]</data>
