  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100584236-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "thus, when rainwater is concentrated on the catchment surface 2 in which contamination by contaminants is prevented early by the titanium dioxide photocatalyst layer, the rainwater is transferred to the storage tank 1 through the catchment port 3 and stored"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100739875-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a sewage removal type sewage structure in a public drainage system to remove foreign substances contained in rainwater and to prevent contamination or clogging of sewage pipes due to deposition of foreign substances"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100842368-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it is another object of the present invention to prevent contamination of rainwater and surroundings by the odor of sewage, which is a domestic sewage, in the process of discharging sediments, and also to prevent rainwater intrusion of rainwater, and to separate the rainwater drainage and the wastewater drainage when necessary"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101101703-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "according to the present invention, it is possible to effectively purify the rainwater having a high degree of contamination, and to variably mount the biostone storage means by the rack and the rack support frame, thereby simplifying the installation and removal in the filtration tank and the long-term rainwater filtration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323649-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater flows along the pipeline during the supply or discharge of rainwater, thereby minimizing contamination due to the propagation of microorganisms in the rainwater by maintaining uniform time of stagnation in the rainwater storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, during rain, the initial rainwater containing non-point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non-point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102076296-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the rainwater is stored in the storage tank 20 by using the drainage line 40, the rainwater is recovered cleanly to prevent contamination, odors, pest breeding, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102076296-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the rainwater is stored in the storage tank 20 by using the drainage line 40, the rainwater is recovered cleanly to prevent contamination, odors, pest breeding, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102141002-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore, by the rainwater collecting well 10 of the present invention, the initial rainwater is discharged through the drain pipe 11, and the rainwater having a low degree of contamination can be discharged through the collecting pipe 16 to store more clean rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102281312-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to the instantaneous pressure and discharge, it is finely pulverized and stabilized while exerting a strong cleaning power, thereby preventing contamination of the inside of the storage tank 10 and the rainwater stored inside the storage tank 10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102290677-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it has the effect of preventing clogging of the contact media and infiltration tanks, and contamination of soil and rivers.1 is a front view showing a rainwater treatment facility capable of excluding pipe-type initial rainwater according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200446316-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "sewage should be supplied with household sewage from homes or commercial buildings near sewer pipes, and rainwater quickly drains rainwater generated during rainfall or snowfall to prevent road flooding and to prevent contamination from rainwater splashing"}]</data>
