in multiple stages on the sewage pipe 10 to prevent the inflow of contaminants into the stormwater chamber 11 by separating various contaminants in advance before the initial rainwater reaches the first opening and closing plate 111"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101014995-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the amount of water increases, the water level sensor detects and opens the initial rainwater blocking door to remove the foreign matter from the primary strainer after collecting the rainwater from the primary strainer, filter it once more from the strainer, and then remove the foreign substance in the sedimentation chamber for final precipitation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101039196-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this structure is to block the inflow of the initial excellent water when the internal water level of the first excellent soil chamber 21 and the second excellent soil chamber 31 is increased due to the continuous inflow of the initial excellent rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101132847-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "1 is a block diagram showing a state in which rain and earth inflow prevention device having a buoyancy chamber according to the first embodiment of the present invention is installed, fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101215187-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the high water level alarm sensor 46 is a water level of the sewage and rainwater in the chamber 12 of the collecting facility 10 above the limit point because the sewage pipe 16 is not blocked in the rain due to a malfunction of the first water level detection sensor 42"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101250076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater is introduced into the inflow chamber 123a3 and the contaminants are removed by the debris receiver 123b during the process of passing through the inflow chamber 123a3"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101250076-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater from the inflow chamber 123a3 flows into the treatment chamber 123a4 and is processed by the treatment action of the contaminant filtration / adsorption means 123c while passing through the treatment chamber 123a4 and then into the outflow chamber 123a5"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101258565-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the rainwater introduced into the rainwater chamber 10 is increased in quantity and gradually increased in water level to reach the moving induction plate 300 installed in the sewage inlet 22 and the blocking plate 260"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101545448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "[ the end of the horizontal channel section 133 is clogged by the partition wall 111c while the guide channel 132b formed by the horizontal channel section 133 is formed by the opening 135 formed in the partition wall 111c so that the initial rain can be discharged through the opening 135 to the interior of the discharge chamber 116, which will be described later, and the opening 135 is blocked to be openable by the opening / closing door 136"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101926744-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the contaminants settled in the excellent water collecting chamber 11 lower the degree of purification of excellent purification, the water is guided to the contaminant discharge chamber 12 so as not to feed water to the purified water supply water chamber 14, which is conducted through the drain portion 16"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101989601-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the opening and closing member 55 coupled with the lifting rod 51 is coupled to the upper storage chamber 35 when the lifting rod 51 moves upward to block the discharge port 39 to prevent the discharge of the rainwater to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102008617-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "at the end of the sewer pipe (1), the sewage discharge port (2) is normally closed to guide the sewage to the sewage treatment plant through the rainwater discharge chamber (3) to block the discharge of odors and to increase the amount of sewage into rainwater that flows during rainy weather"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102055349-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, by simplifying the structure of the permeation ditches, the efficiency of rainwater discharge is increased, and at the same time, contaminants are removed from the pretreatment water, the irrigation chamber, and the ditches, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102388770-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the upper inlet 111 may receive sewage from which contaminants have been removed by the contaminant screen 103 and introduce it into the rainwater chamber 110"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102408952-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the upper inlet 111 may receive sewage from which contaminants have been removed by the contaminant screen 103 and introduce it into the rainwater chamber 110"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102773372-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seals the rainwater receiving chamber (420) with the buoyancy of the rainwater (c), thereby blocking the fluid inflow into the casing (100)"}]</data>
