  <data key="d6">["step", "decompose", "contaminate", "fight", "retain", "increase", "prepare", "reduce", "fill", "form", "stream", "configure", "accord", "continue", "induce", "remove", "describe", "prevent", "supply", "mention", "instal", "exceed", "secure", "construct", "float", "refer", "damage", "combine", "shut off", "collide", "coexist", "flow", "be", "deposit", "provide", "inhabit", "spread", "minimize", "store", "block", "want", "perform", "show", "occur", "stay", "contain"]</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "JP-4570636-B2", "para_id": "para_8", "text": "in order to further reduce the momentum of the water flowing into the river water reservoir 2 through the dewatering pond 7, a concrete speed reducing block 8 is installed between the river water reservoir 2 and the diversion reservoir 7"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4570636-B2", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "as a result, the energy of the flowing water when colliding with the resin skeleton block 11 in the river water reservoir 2 is further reduced, and the water storage space formed by the resin skeleton block 11 of the river water reservoir 2 is less likely to be damaged"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100748018-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, if the water stays in the reservoir for a long time, the contaminants are increased by condensation and contaminate the river water rather than being decomposed naturally"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100748018-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when this condition is continued and water is filled in the reservoir, contaminants, such as sludge, are deposited at the bottom of the river due to material lumping, as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101006852-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the partitions 12 and 13 induce the flow of the river water in the reservoir 11 so that fines or contaminants contained in the river water are not deposited so that the bottom of the reservoir 11 is not blocked"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101048805-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "as described above, the characteristics of the present invention is in the partition wall, the purpose of installing the partition wall is to induce the flow of water fines or contaminants contained in the river water this prevents sedimentation so that no blockage occurs at the bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101067632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "of the reservoir or river prevents turbid water diffusion that prevents contamination of the reservoir or stream so that it is economically appropriately blocked before it spreads inward, so that only clean water from which the soil and contaminants have been removed from the turbid water flows into the reservoir or stream to prevent contamination"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101196227-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, in order to prepare for the water shortage situation, there are ways to minimize the problems of securing the water by blocking the above-mentioned large artificial dam, reservoir or river water, and to secure the water that is insufficient without performing relatively large construction"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101468324-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "10 (a), the third open / close board 40 of the present invention can be shut off passively, so that even when the rain is over in the event of an emergency, the river floods or exceeds the sewage treatment capacity of the sewage end treatment plant , it is possible to block a multiple of the initial storm stored in the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101518747-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the shore protection block of the present invention can be installed in a lake, a dam reservoir slope, a river, or a ditch to provide a space where various aquatic plants, aquatic insects and fish can coexist along with water purification.10"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102091573-B1", "para_id": "claim_9", "text": "at the lower end of the combined rainwater collection channel 999, a rainwater or contaminants contaminated with rivers or rivers or reservoirs or dams while constructing a stepped artificial reef 890 where organisms, amphibians, or fish can be easily inhabited"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102290035-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in the prior art, even if a fire-fighting helicopter wants to be supplied with fire-fighting water from a river, lake, or reservoir, the suction hose of the fire-fighting helicopter is blocked due to numerous floating objects in or on the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102714328-B1", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "the structure of an eco-friendly movable dam for preventing green algae occurrence, which is configured to block a river and retain water according to each embodiment of the present invention, and a dam, reservoir, lake, lagoon, or estuary dam are collectively referred to as an eco-friendly movable dam for preventing green algae occurrence (8888)"}]</data>
</edge>
