oirs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101206269-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "rainwater can be sent to the vegetation reservoir 170, and the degree of purification of rainwater can be increased by passing through a plurality of prefabricated blocks 102 and 103"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101282720-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the inner section of the reservoir 48 blocks the contact with the rainwater, and the fine soil or suspended matter contained in the rainwater is provided to be filtered while being contained in the cleaning bag 35"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101308064-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "since the inclined guide plate 25 is formed in a corrugated form and is inclined, the inclined guide plate 25 generates resistance to rainwater flow rate moving to the reservoir 2 to prevent rapid flow, while fine contaminants continuously impinge on the corrugated surface"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101323288-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "is not only to filter out pollutants introduced with rainwater to the storm pipe (5) side as well , removes low-density floating contaminants and sends them down to the reservoir penetrating portion (10c) side of the lower portion, the reservoir penetrating portion (10c) to send rainwater introduced from the infiltration vegetation portion (10b)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101326602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by opening a large amount of rainwater into the reservoir quickly and allowing it to be discharged into the drain, it is possible to respond quickly to the rainy weather conditions of the road, and also to prevent leakage of odors from the underground drainage to the outside and the introduction of foreign substances into the drain can be controlled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101351825-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in one embodiment, a sufficient amount of rainwater is stored in the side reservoir panel 130 to block the inflow of rainwater, or once stored so that foreign matter does not block the inlet 121 or the filter portion 122 while it is not raining"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101485001-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, the rainwater infiltrated through the permeable press block flows directly into the reservoir 500 through the induction pipe installed under the permeable press block, and the road effluent flowing through the rainwater receiver on the road passes through the filtration tank and then flows into the storage tank 500 after the initial storm has been processed through the storage tank 300"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101564767-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a fourth step of constructing a permeable packing layer on the non-point pollution source-reduced prefabricated storage block constructed through the third step, into the reservoir space of the non-point pollution source-reduced prefabricated reservoir block through the permeable packing layer, permeable rainwater storage tank for filtering the rainwater and penetrating through the permeable base layer"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101833824-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, in the case of the storage cell 41 located at the outermost layer, the flow path 411 may be blocked to form the entire reservoir layer 4, (4) should be able to store rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102091573-B1", "para_id": "claim_9", "text": "at the lower end of the combined rainwater collection channel 999, a rainwater or contaminants contaminated with rivers or rivers or reservoirs or dams while constructing a stepped artificial reef 890 where organisms, amphibians, or fish can be easily inhabited"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200414264-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the rainwater collection modification, the rainwater collection pipe 1 is connected to induce rainwater, and the rainwater collection pipe 1 is installed at the end of the rainwater contaminant treatment device, and a rainwater reservoir is connected to the end of the rainwater reservoir"}]</data>
